{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this module to track events from SwiftUI views on Apple platforms; elsewhere it builds empty.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Set a tracker once, at the root of the views, with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tracker(_:)"},{"text":", and read it in any view below","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Environment(\\.tracker)"},{"text":". A button’s action can track through it, which a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withTracker"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"binding can’t reach, since SwiftUI runs actions on tasks of its own. Until a tracker is set, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"environment’s tracker tracks through the one ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tracker.bootstrap"},{"text":" made the process’s default, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with none it drops each event, warning once per call site. In a preview it is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tracker.noOp"},{"text":", so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a preview tracks nothing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The modifiers track through the environment’s tracker, once per trigger, and record the place","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"they are applied as the call site. ","type":"text"},{"code":"trackOnAppear(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" tracks each time a view appears,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"trackOnTap(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" each tap beside the view’s own action, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"trackChange(of:_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" each new value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"trackScreen(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" tracks ","type":"text"},{"code":"ScreenViewed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" each time the view appears, and puts a tracker enriched","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the screen’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"ScreenKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the environment inside it, so every event tracked from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"screen carries its name:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import SwiftUI","import Traffluent","","@Event","struct CartOpened {}","","@Event","struct CheckoutStarted {","    var cartSize: Int","}","","struct CartView: View {","    @Environment(\\.tracker) private var tracker","","    var body: some View {","        List {","            Button(\"Check out\") {","                tracker.track(CheckoutStarted(cartSize: 3))  \/\/ its record's context[ScreenKey.self] is \"Cart\"","            }","        }","        .trackOnAppear(CartOpened())","    }","}","","let tracker = Tracker()","let root = CartView()","    .trackScreen(\"Cart\")  \/\/ tracks ScreenViewed(screen: \"Cart\") each time it appears","    .tracker(tracker)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Apply ","type":"text"},{"code":"trackScreen(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" where the screen’s view is placed, as above, not in the view’s own ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a view’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Environment","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reads the environment around it, which its own body’s modifiers don’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Where UIKit has traits, the environment’s tracker is the same value as UIKit’s trait"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/UIKitTracking\/documentation\/UIKitTracking"},{"type":"text","text":"), so SwiftUI views hosted in UIKit read the scene’s tracker. For UIKit and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"AppKit views, see "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/UIKitTracking\/documentation\/UIKitTracking"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/appkittracking"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To track screens without a modifier on each, see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/automaticscreentracking"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The guide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingfromviews"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers all three frameworks."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"API","text":"API","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The documentation site is built on Linux, where this module’s views aren’t there, so their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"symbols have no pages of their own here. Their doc comments are in the sources, and Xcode shows","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them for an Apple target. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking\/ScreenViewed"},{"text":" builds on every platform, as does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ScreenKey"},{"text":", in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Events","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" module, so a tracking plan or a collector off Apple","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"platforms can name them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Setting-the-tracker","text":"Setting the tracker","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EnvironmentValues.tracker"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"View.tracker(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Tracking-from-views","text":"Tracking from views","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View.trackOnAppear(_:)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"View.trackOnTap(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View.trackChange(of:_:)"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Screens","text":"Screens","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View.trackScreen(_:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking\/ScreenViewed","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Structures","anchor":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking\/ScreenViewed"]}],"metadata":{"title":"SwiftUITracking","symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","modules":[{"name":"SwiftUITracking"}],"externalID":"SwiftUITracking"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Give SwiftUI views a tracker through the environment, and track what they do with view modifiers.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftuitracking"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://SwiftUITracking/documentation/SwiftUITracking":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiftuitracking","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking","abstract":[{"text":"Give SwiftUI views a tracker through the environment, and track what they do with view modifiers.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","title":"SwiftUITracking","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/ScreenKey":{"title":"ScreenKey","url":"\/documentation\/events\/screenkey","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ScreenKey","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScreenKey"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" key of the screen an event was tracked from: the name given to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackScreen(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftUITracking"},{"type":"text","text":"), or to a screen tracked automatically."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScreenKey"}]},"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/automaticscreentracking":{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/automaticscreentracking","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/automaticscreentracking","title":"AutomaticScreenTracking","titleInlineContent":[{"code":"AutomaticScreenTracking","type":"codeVoice"}]},"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/trackingfromviews":{"titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Tracking from SwiftUI, UIKit and AppKit","type":"text"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingfromviews","title":"Tracking from SwiftUI, UIKit and AppKit","url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingfromviews","type":"link"},"doc://SwiftUITracking/documentation/SwiftUITracking/ScreenViewed":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiftuitracking\/screenviewed","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking\/ScreenViewed","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Someone viewed the screen named "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking\/ScreenViewed\/screen","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": what "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackScreen(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" tracks each time its view"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"appears."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScreenViewed"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"ScreenViewed","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScreenViewed"}]},"doc://SwiftUITracking/documentation/SwiftUITracking/ScreenViewed/screen":{"title":"screen","url":"\/documentation\/swiftuitracking\/screenviewed\/screen","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking\/ScreenViewed\/screen","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"screen","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The viewed screen’s name."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/appkittracking":{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/appkittracking","url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/appkittracking","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppKitTracking"}],"title":"AppKitTracking"},"doc://UIKitTracking/documentation/UIKitTracking":{"url":"\